DESCRIPTION:Join us on a Tuesday evening from 6pm for Belles and Chimes wom
 en’s pinball meetup in the Netherworld! Belles and Chimes (www.bellesand
 chimespinball.com) is a group of meetups established in 2013 that happens 
 around the world to provide a casual\, inclusive space to learn and play p
 inball with like minded folks. There’s no strict format – all you need
  to do is meet up\, grab a drink and play! It will happen monthly on Tuesd
 ays throughout the year. It’s free to join in and is open to women and n
 on-binary persons of all skills levels.
